  "title": "Conjecture: per-irrep character differences factor via $\\Phi_{4 f_\\lambda}(q)$, where $f_\\lambda$ is the SYT count — verified at $n=3$ for $V_{(3)}, V_{(2,1)}, V_{(1,1,1)}$; predicts cyclotomic structure at all $n$",
